<title>USA: AmVestors hires Goldman Sach for advice.</title>
<headline>AmVestors hires Goldman Sach for advice.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kansas 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmVestors Financial Corp said it hired Goldman Sachs &amp; Co to advise the company on strategic alternatives.</p>
<p>Those alternatives could include a possible sale or merger of the company, said the insurer.</p>
<p>&quot;With the current consolidation activity taking place within the life insurance industry, the board of directors determined that it was appropriate to hire a financial advisor to explore the alternatives to maximize shareholder value,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
